{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crash-landed on a mysterious planet rich with <i>Mightium</i> - the most powerful energy source in the galaxy - the <strong>Mighty Miners</strong> must dig, blast, and upgrade their way to survival. But they\u2019re not alone. The villainous <strong>Star Pirates</strong> have also arrived, and they\u2019ll stop at nothing to steal every last ounce for themselves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Based on the fictional  1987 animated series <i>Mighty Miners</i>, this action-packed game adaptation puts you in control of both the heroes and the villains in a chaotic race to harvest resources, complete tasks, and unlock unstoppable power.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run you mine resources and survive as long as possible while keeping an eye out for mysterious items, hidden stashes and ways to refill your slowly draining energy meter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs, spend your earnings, complete tasks, purchase permanent upgrades and unlock new levels of power that simple words can't do justice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying mining action, powered by automated weaponry and simple controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock weapons, items, upgrades, characters, systems, stages and more in a cascade of things to put in your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and gain immense permanent power through different meta systems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of tasks to complete with juicy rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple semi-randomized levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple screen shake settings, wow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some kind of fungus</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3325490?t=1758197514","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steam